---
/**
 * Branding Section
 *
 * About page section highlighting the Chassis logo and icon, with download links for use in articles, talks, and other references.
 */
---

<section class="py-3xl md:py-6xl">
  <div class="container 2xl">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-md lg:gap-3xl">
      <header>
        <h2>Branding</h2>
        <p class="font-lg">
          Use the Chassis logo and icon when you reference the project — in articles, talks, or
          slides. Please don't modify the marks or place them in a way that implies official
          endorsement of your work. Click any mark below to download the SVG.
        </p>
      </header>
      <div class="lg:pt-6xl">
        <div class="grid gap-md grid-cols-2">
          <div>
            <a
              href="/static/images/logo/logo-light.svg"
              download
              class="d-flex p-3xl border border-subtle rounded"
            >
              <img
                src="/static/images/logo/logo-light.svg"
                alt="Chassis logo"
                class="object-fit-cover w-100"
                width="320"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
          <div>
            <a
              href="/static/images/logo/logo-dark.svg"
              download
              class="d-flex p-3xl border border-subtle rounded bg-inverse"
            >
              <img
                src="/static/images/logo/logo-dark.svg"
                alt="Chassis logo"
                class="object-fit-cover w-100"
                width="320"
              />
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
